{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07472","headline":"送马秀才落第归江南 · 刘长卿","name":"送马秀才落第归江南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南客怀归乡梦频，东门怅别柳条新。\n殷懃斗酒城阴暮，荡漾孤舟楚水春。\n湘竹旧斑思帝子，江蓠初绿怨骚人。\n怜君此去未得意，陌上愁看泪满巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07472.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07472","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}